    ["61级6人本BOSS普通"] = "Level 61 6-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["<InvDefault>1.为了提升游戏公平性，【礼金】功能调整了的每日领取上限，以便让更多非凡者领取到礼金。</>\n<InvDefault>2.【副本】</>\n<InvDefault>1）修复了副本【记忆的传承·强尼】中替罪羔羊技能伤害区域提示不够明显的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>2）下调了副本【黑荆棘事件簿·亡者疑踪】中【亡者隘口】关卡中僵尸群的移动速度。</>\n<InvDefault>3）下调了副本【黑荆棘事件簿·亡者疑踪】中【破晓防线】关卡中僵尸的攻击力。</>\n<InvDefault>4）增加了副本【黑荆棘事件簿·亡者疑踪】中【破晓防线】关卡中僵尸的攻击间隔。</>\n<InvDefault>5）下调了副本【乌托邦剧院·普通】和【乌托邦剧院·困难】整体难度，并下调了首领【亵渎魔女】的伤害。</>\n<InvDefault>3.【剧情】</>\n<InvDefault>1）修复了特殊情况下原著主线《意外的访客》中邓恩表现异常的问题 。</>\n<InvDefault>2）提高了现实主线第四章《镜中的廷根》异变狼人战斗中，玩家【霰弹枪】技能、【手枪射击】的伤害。</>\n<InvDefault>4.【跑团】</>\n<InvDefault>1）修复了特定情况下【秩序世界】玩法中【非凡扮演】因交互物消失导致流程停滞的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>2）优化了【城市暗面】剧情事件【血色谢幕】中邦尼加冕仪式的玩法指引，并下调了玩法难度。</>\n<InvDefault>3）修复了特定情况下【秩序世界】霍纳奇斯花海地图，坐标【518,316】处的异象之物无法正常显示获取的问题，非凡者可前往对应点位正常获取异象之物。</>\n<InvDefault>5.【装备】</>\n<InvDefault>1）修复了武器恩赐【铁火铸就的盟约】中，铁火状态伤害频率描述错误的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>2）修复了装备词条中，格挡属性的描述错误的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>6.修复了特殊情况下【占卜家】获取卡牌时，卡牌颜色显示异常的问题 。</>\n<InvDefault>7.优化了【家族】系统招募相关提示文本。</>\n<InvDefault>8.修复了特殊情况下【学徒】无法获得足迹的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>9.修复了少数情况下，【秘偶许愿】保底不生效的问题，完成数据核查后，将根据受影响的次数补偿对应的【金纺线】道具。 </>\n<InvDefault>10.修复了小部分时装染色后表现不一致的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>11.修复了PC端异常出现移动端壁纸的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>12.修复了特殊情况下【命运时刻】、【主宰争锋】、【神座之争】实际段位分变化正常但结算面板段位分变化显示异常的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>13.修复了使用不同词条数的非凡物质聚合时获得<The Fool>词条保底值异常偏低的问题，后续会对之前进行过不同词条数聚合（例如六词条与二词条、五词条与三词条等）的非凡者补发缺失的<The Fool>词条保底进度。</>\n<InvDefault>14.修复了【人脉好感度】中佛尔思邀约对话称呼错误的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>15.修复了少数情况下【交易所】抢购商品失败时不返还苏勒的情况，完成数据核查后，将全额退还未返还的苏勒。</>\n<InvDefault>16.修复了极少数情况下鸿蒙平台切换渠道登录不生效的问题。</>\n<InvDefault>17.优化了【观众】部分技能的施放速度和手感，相应地略微下调治疗效果，保证整体治疗效率不变。</>"] = "<InvDefault>1. To improve game fairness, the daily claim limit for 【Gift Money】 has been adjusted so more Beyonders can receive it.</>\n<InvDefault>2.【Dungeons】</>\n<InvDefault>1）Fixed an issue where the damage-area indicator for the Scapegoat skill was insufficiently visible in 【Legacy of Memory · Johnny】.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Reduced the movement speed of zombie groups in the 【Dead Man's Pass】 stage of 【Blackthorn Casebook · Mystery of the Dead】.</>\n<InvDefault>3）Reduced zombie attack power in the 【Dawn Defense Line】 stage of 【Blackthorn Casebook · Mystery of the Dead】.</>\n<InvDefault>4）Increased the interval between zombie attacks in the 【Dawn Defense Line】 stage of 【Blackthorn Casebook · Mystery of the Dead】.</>\n<InvDefault>5）Reduced the overall difficulty of 【Utopia Theatre · Normal】 and 【Utopia Theatre · Hard】, and reduced the damage dealt by the boss 【Blasphemy Sorceress】.</>\n<InvDefault>3.【Story】</>\n<InvDefault>1）Fixed Dunn behaving incorrectly under special circumstances in the original-story main quest 《An Unexpected Visitor》.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Increased the damage of the player's 【Shotgun】 skill and 【Pistol Shot】 during the mutated werewolf battle in Chapter Four of the real-world main quest 《Tingen in the Mirror》.</>\n<InvDefault>4.【TRPG】</>\n<InvDefault>1）Fixed an issue where 【Beyonder Acting】 could become stuck when an interactive object disappeared in 【World of Order】.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Improved the gameplay guidance for Bonnie's coronation ritual in the 【Crimson Curtain Call】 story event of 【Dark Side of the City】, and reduced its difficulty.</>\n<InvDefault>3）Fixed an Anomaly Item at coordinates 【518,316】 on the Hornacis Flower Sea map in 【World of Order】 not appearing or being obtainable correctly. Beyonders can now visit the location to obtain it normally.</>\n<InvDefault>5.【Equipment】</>\n<InvDefault>1）Fixed an incorrect description of the Ironfire state's damage frequency for the weapon boon 【Covenant Forged in Iron and Fire】.</>\n<InvDefault>2）Fixed an incorrect description of the Block attribute on equipment affixes.</>\n<InvDefault>6. Fixed card colors displaying incorrectly when a 【Seer】 obtained cards under special circumstances.</>\n<InvDefault>7. Improved recruitment-related text in the 【Family】 system.</>\n<InvDefault>8. Fixed an issue where 【Apprentice】 could not obtain Footprints under special circumstances.</>\n<InvDefault>9. Fixed the pity guarantee for 【Marionette Wish】 not activating in rare cases. After data verification, affected players will receive the corresponding 【Golden Spun Thread】 items based on the number of affected attempts.</>\n<InvDefault>10. Fixed minor inconsistencies in the appearance of some dyed outfits.</>\n<InvDefault>11. Fixed mobile wallpapers appearing unexpectedly on PC.</>\n<InvDefault>12. Fixed the settlement panel incorrectly displaying ranked-point changes in 【Moment of Destiny】, 【Battle for Supremacy】, and 【Throne War】 under special circumstances, despite the actual ranked-point changes being correct.</>\n<InvDefault>13. Fixed the <The Fool> affix pity value being abnormally low when combining Beyonder materials with different affix counts. Beyonders who previously combined materials with different affix counts, such as six-affix with two-affix or five-affix with three-affix materials, will receive the missing <The Fool> affix pity progress.</>\n<InvDefault>14. Fixed an incorrect form of address in Fors's invitation dialogue under 【Contact Affinity】.</>\n<InvDefault>15. Fixed rare cases where soli were not returned after a failed rush purchase on the 【Exchange】. After data verification, all unreturned soli will be refunded.</>\n<InvDefault>16. Fixed channel switching at login occasionally failing on the HarmonyOS platform.</>\n<InvDefault>17. Improved the casting speed and feel of some 【Spectator】 skills while slightly reducing their healing effects, keeping overall healing efficiency unchanged.</>",
